# Managed by dotfiles (~/dotfiles/yt-dlp/config -> ~/.config/yt-dlp/config).
# Allow yt-dlp to fetch its official EJS challenge-solver script from yt-dlp's
# GitHub releases — required since YouTube's 2026 "n challenge" changes;
# without it, YouTube downloads fail with HTTP 403. The solver runs in a local
# JS runtime (deno preferred). https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/wiki/EJS
--remote-components ejs:github
